WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,460
I gave you the addresses and metals of my friends.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,460
Don't send it to the wrong mountain

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,460
Delivery to each household based on address

4
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,460
Check it out again before departure

5
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,460
Don't worry, brother

6
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:17,820
I'm all right

7
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,820
Give me some pork

8
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:19,820
Also driving a deer and tiger?

9
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,820
Take a look

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,680
The meat and portion are both good, right?

11
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,480
I will buy from you next time

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:29,480
Is this the kind of pork Gong Jie is talking about?

13
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,480
Please check the weights

14
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,410
component pair

15
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,410
I confirm the harvest

16
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:35,820
Can I still buy it tomorrow?

17
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,820
Everything is booked for today

18
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,820
Will there be any tomorrow?

19
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,820
I have to go back and ask my brother
